<title>FINLAND: FINNISH RAW WOOD PRICES MIXED IN FEBRUARY - METLA.</title>
<headline>FINNISH RAW WOOD PRICES MIXED IN FEBRUARY - METLA.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish raw wood stumpage</p>
<p>prices were mixed in February (weeks 6-9), the Finnish Forest</p>
<p>Research Institute METLA said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Logwood stumpage prices rose in February, but pine and birch</p>
<p>pulpwood stumpage prices fell, it said.</p>
<p>Pulpwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre):</p>
<p>	     Feb '97    Jan '97  Dec '96</p>
<p> Pine	  96.70	97.00    98.10</p>
<p> Spruce     126.70     126.20   123.40</p>
<p> Birch	 94.30	94.50    94.30</p>
<p>Logwood stumpage prices (markka per cubic metre):</p>
<p>	     Feb '97    Jan '97  Dec '96</p>
<p> Pine	 252.20     251.40   248.00</p>
<p> Spruce     208.80     207.30   205.60</p>
<p> Birch	250.20     246.60   247.20</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@Reuters.fi</p>
</text>
